1
00:00:21,455 --> 00:00:28,773
Fever’s gone, my mask is shed.
Curls of black around my head.

2
00:00:28,964 --> 00:00:36,539
Hip to hip, our shadows clench.
Come with me, my heart to tease.

3
00:00:36,701 --> 00:00:44,283
I grab your coat, I hold you tight.
Tender kiss into the night.

4
00:00:44,584 --> 00:00:53,042
You feel the freedom in my touch.
But the flying is too much.

5
00:01:01,836 --> 00:01:09,239
Garage door groans, heavy shut.
I smell your winter coat.

6
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:17,054
Key in hand to find the night.
Safe and hollow from my lip.

7
00:01:17,506 --> 00:01:25,017
You fold your wings, you start to run.
Before the flight has even begun.

8
00:01:25,259 --> 00:01:33,147
I scream inside, a silent cry
But I won’t break, I will not die.

9
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:44,218
My heart beats wild and loud.
I’ve seen the heaven in your eye.

10
00:01:44,448 --> 00:01:51,952
Tears are burning on my cheek.
I can’t let you walk away.

11
00:01:52,221 --> 00:01:59,132
I grab your coat, I hold you tight.
Tender kiss into the night.

12
00:01:59,737 --> 00:02:07,483
You feel the freedom in my touch.
But the flying is too much.

13
00:02:17,089 --> 00:02:24,264
Feet are frozen to the floor.
Left alone behind the door.

14
00:02:24,691 --> 00:02:32,123
Warm salty tears descend.
Is this really how we end?

15
00:02:32,337 --> 00:02:39,641
You fold your wings, you start to run.
Before the flight has even begun.

16
00:02:40,010 --> 00:02:48,319
I scream inside, a silent cry
But I won’t break, I will not die.

17
00:02:51,181 --> 00:02:58,898
Sink to my knees against the wood.
Silent scream inside my chest.

18
00:02:59,039 --> 00:03:06,470
Bite my lip until it bleeds.
I won’t break beneath your cowl.

19
00:03:06,663 --> 00:03:13,824
I grab your coat, I hold you tight.
Tender kiss into the night.

20
00:03:14,093 --> 00:03:22,736
You feel the freedom in my touch.
But the flying is too much.

21
00:03:38,896 --> 00:03:46,378
Saturday, the sun is low.
Blue skirt moving, soft and slow.

22
00:03:46,533 --> 00:03:53,844
No more glasses, see me clear.
Love is where I choose to stand.

23
00:03:54,095 --> 00:04:01,050
You fold your wings, you start to run.
Before the flight has even begun.

24
00:04:01,323 --> 00:04:07,686
I scream inside, a silent cry
But I won’t break,

25
00:04:08,619 --> 00:04:12,930
I will not die.

